<translation id="6422885447166607802">Parollar, bukmarklar va tarixni qurilmalararo mukammal sinxronlashda davom eting. Birlamchi brauzerni Bravega yangilab, tanish va sevimli funksiyalardan oson foydalaning.</translation>
<translation id="8919461291440820124">Growser mikrofondan foydalanmoqda.</translation>
<translation id="3130333203120345554">Yangi qidiruv</translation>
<translation id="3137969841538672700">Qidirish uchun obyektni torting</translation>
<translation id="8372436892102763334">Bu varaq ortiqcha resurs sarflayapti. Unumdorlikni kuchaytirish uchun Growser varaqni nofaol qilishiga ruxsat bering.</translation>
<translation id="5949068186379578553">Ekranni ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Growser uchun ekranni yozib olishga ruxsat bering.</translation>
