<translation id="5499063270485366718">Agar rasmga foydali tavsif berilmagan boʻlsa, Growser uni sizga tavsiflaydi. Tavsif yaratish uchun rasmlar Bravega yuboriladi.</translation>
<translation id="1196733835766994012"><ph name="DEVICE_TYPE"/> qurilmangizda Growser ilovasi bilan AI qudratini his eting</translation>
